/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Determinable\040and\040non\055determinable\040parameters\040of\040galvanic\040distortion\040in\040magnetotellurics)
/Author (H\056\040M\056\040Bibby\054\040Todd\040G\056\040Caldwell\054\040Colin\040Brown)
/Subject (SUMMARY\015\012\015\012Galvanic\040distortion\040has\040long\040been\040recognized\040as\040an\040obstacle\040in\040the\040interpretation\040of\040magnetotelluric\040\050MT\051\040data\056\040One\040fundamental\040problem\040for\040distortion\040removal\040is\040that\040the\040equations\040that\040describe\040the\040effects\040of\040galvanic\040distortion\040on\040the\040impedance\040tensor\040are\040underdetermined\056\040We\040have\040previously\040shown\040that\040an\040explicit\040solution\040for\040four\040of\040the\040parameters\040of\040the\040regional\040\050undistorted\051\040impedance\040tensor\040can\040be\040resolved\040without\040any\040assumptions\056\040These\040determinable\040parameters\040are\040the\040components\040of\040a\040tensor\040\050the\040phase\040tensor\051\040representing\040the\040phase\040information\040contained\040in\040the\040impedance\056\040The\040coordinate\040invariants\040of\040the\040phase\040tensor\040provide\040a\040simple\040and\040objective\040guide\040to\040the\040dimensionality\040of\040the\040regional\040impedance\040tensor\040at\040each\040measured\040frequency\056\040Where\040the\040regional\040structure\040is\0402\055D\054\040one\040of\040the\040principal\040axes\040of\040the\040phase\040tensor\040will\040be\040aligned\040parallel\040to\040the\040strike\040of\040the\040regional\040conductivity\056\040The\040distortion\040tensor\040and\040the\040parameters\040of\040the\040regional\040impedance\040tensor\040that\040represent\040the\040amplitude\040information\040cannot\040be\040determined\040without\040assumptions\056\040Where\040the\040phase\040tensor\040shows\040the\040regional\040impedance\040tensor\040to\040be\0401\055D\054\040the\040distortion\040tensor\040and\040the\040regional\040impedance\040can\040be\040determined\040to\040within\040a\040single\040multiplicative\040constant\056\040Where\040a\0402\055D\040regional\040structure\040is\040indicated\054\040two\040assumptions\040are\040necessary\040to\040determine\040the\040regional\040impedance\040tensor\040but\040the\040solution\040is\040not\040unique\054\040and\040any\040choice\040of\040assumptions\040could\040be\040made\040with\040equal\040validity\056\040For\0403\055D\040structures\054\040the\040phase\040tensor\040provides\040the\040direction\040of\040greatest\040inductive\040response\054\040which\040is\040the\040closest\040equivalent\040of\040a\040strike\040direction\056\040In\040this\040case\040four\040constraints\040are\040required\040for\040a\040solution\056\040In\040practice\054\040a\040MT\040sounding\040may\040contain\040sections\040that\040display\040different\040characteristic\040dimension\040and\040the\040distortion\040tensor\040can\040be\040determined\040from\040the\040section\040of\040the\040sounding\040with\040the\040lowest\040characteristic\040dimension\056\040The\040greatest\040amount\040of\040information\040is\040determined\040from\040a\0401\055D\040section\056\040The\040use\040of\040the\040information\040contained\040in\040the\040phase\040tensor\040overcomes\040some\040of\040the\040shortcomings\040of\040traditional\040distortion\040analysis\056\040Illustrating\040the\040tensors\040using\040an\040elliptical\040representation\040aids\040the\040interpretation\040of\040the\040tensor\040data\040involved\040in\040this\040analysis\056)
/Keywords (01\040Dec\0402005\054\040Geophysical\040Journal\040International\054\040Tensor\040density\054\040Tensor\054\040Cartesian\040tensor\054\040Maxwell\040stress\040tensor\054\040Distortion\054\040National\040University\040of\040Ireland)
>>
endobj
